@baseUrl = https://localhost:7077

### 1. Inregistrare
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "client@test.com",
  "password": "Parola123",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Client"
}

### 2. Login (copiaza tokenul din raspuns)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "client@test.com",
  "password": "Parola123"
}

### 3. Endpoint protejat
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..nBvNeknWG506zBb01R8azEKwtM3WgHjsdS2MRQ5eX9o

### 4. Fara token (trebuie sa dea 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### 5. Login frizer (copiaza tokenul)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "frizer1@test.com",
  "password": "Frizer1234"
}

### 6. Endpoint de frizer cu token de frizer (trebuie 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/barber-only
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..6vbPAy8WOINLPNVg7YrKr3ZlVv1CTt6-fLclShMjvyE

### 7. Endpoint de frizer cu token de client (trebuie 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/barber-only
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..nBvNeknWG506zBb01R8azEKwtM3WgHjsdS2MRQ5eX9o

### 8. Endpoint de frizer fara token (trebuie 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/barber-only

### 9. Lista de servicii (public, fara token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/services

### 10. Login frizer (copiaza tokenul)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "frizer1@test.com",
  "password": "Frizer1234"
}

### 11. Programul meu, cu token de frizer (trebuie 200, 5 randuri)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/barbers/me/schedule
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..yKWgVbttB_tltfDiMOnVIY9MGHG8OW59PYfVWk8-gFw

### 12. Programul meu, cu token de client (trebuie 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/barbers/me/schedule
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..nBvNeknWG506zBb01R8azEKwtM3WgHjsdS2MRQ5eX9o

### 13. Programul meu, fara token (trebuie 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/barbers/me/schedule

### 14. Lista frizerilor (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/barbers

### 15. Sloturi luni, frizer 1, serviciul 2 (60 min)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/barbers/1/slots?date=2026-10-26&serviceId=2

### 16. Sloturi sambata (zi libera, trebuie lista goala)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/barbers/1/slots?date=2026-10-24&serviceId=2

### 17. Fara data (trebuie 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/barbers/1/slots?serviceId=2

### 18. Serviciu inexistent (trebuie 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/barbers/1/slots?date=2026-10-26&serviceId=99

### 19. Login client (copiaza tokenul)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "client@test.com",
  "password": "Parola123"
}

### 20. Creeaza programare (trebuie 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..WOX9ddxSUTIXRRibMNkQURYXe9nDNVLHgWBDzOBR_4c
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "barberId": 1,
  "serviceId": 2,
  "startUtc": "2026-10-26T07:00:00Z"
}

### 21. Aceeasi cerere din nou (trebuie 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..WOX9ddxSUTIXRRibMNkQURYXe9nDNVLHgWBDzOBR_4c
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "barberId": 1,
  "serviceId": 2,
  "startUtc": "2026-10-26T07:00:00Z"
}

### 22. Ora care se suprapune partial (trebuie 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..WOX9ddxSUTIXRRibMNkQURYXe9nDNVLHgWBDzOBR_4c
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "barberId": 1,
  "serviceId": 3,
  "startUtc": "2026-10-26T07:20:00Z"
}

### 23. Fara token (trebuie 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "barberId": 1,
  "serviceId": 2,
  "startUtc": "2026-10-26T08:00:00Z"
}

### 24. Cu token de frizer (trebuie 403; logheaza-te mai intai ca frizer1@test.com)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..4tEvDxbEr5EnhBUgFotnu7_4MIfBOzd35UlRH4P2oY0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "barberId": 1,
  "serviceId": 2,
  "startUtc": "2026-10-26T08:00:00Z"
}